<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela Mexico trade reaches $640 mln in yr.</title>
<headline>Venezuela Mexico trade reaches $640 mln in yr.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total trade between Venezuela and Mexico grew to $650 million in 1996 up from $594 million in 1995, Mexican commercial attache Arturo Herbert told reporters.</p>
<p>&quot;The agreements that bind the Group of Three are beginning to bear fruit ... we hope see 20 percent growth in 1997,&quot; Herbert said.</p>
<p>The Group of Three is a free trade pact that gathers Mexico, Venezuela and Colombia.</p>
<p>(( -- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
